<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!-- Christmas and winter theme, the red edition (Stacy, 2026-10-28): wine-dark surfaces, cranberry brand, gold accent; pine green only in the decorations of the overlay.
         The text greys are stepped (Disabled < Faint < Dim < Muted < NavText < Label < Subtle < Body) like the other themes, all but Disabled over 4.5:1 on the cards. -->
